    {
      "Text": "Security update for librsvg",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for librsvg fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-96889: Use-after-free when XML includes have duplicated entities (bsc#1282612).\n\nChanges for librsvg:\n\n- Update to version 2.60.3:\n + This is a security release for bug #1241, RUSTSEC-2026-0305 /\n CVE-2026-96889 / bsc#1282612:\n - glgo#GNOME/librsvg#1241: Fix use-after-free when there are\n duplicate XML entities in nested Xinclude documents. Thanks to\n Rafael B. Dias for reporting this in detail.\n - Dependency updates: lopdf for RUSTSEC-2026-0187, crossbeam-epoch for\n RUSTSEC-2026-0204, time for RUSTSEC-2026-0009.\n - The minimum supported Rust version (MSRV) is 1.89.0.\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
